{"id":"5fa3acf328238c71","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions.md","title":"Arithmetic Syntax Operations and Finite Assignments","display":"df-arithmetic-syntax-functions — Arithmetic Syntax Operations and Finite Assignments","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions","aliases":["67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions"],"display":"df-arithmetic-syntax-functions — Arithmetic Syntax Operations and Finite Assignments","depends_on":["[[67-df-formula]]","[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","[[67-df-sequence]]","[[67-df-pr-definitional-extension]]","[[67-df-satisfaction]]","[[67-df-godel-encoding]]"],"revision_status":"locally-revised","machine_verified":false,"verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14","inherited_verification_status":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked","source_proof_status":"本轮核对形式陈述、类型、变量绑定和册内依赖；未重新核验原书 PDF，未作机器证明","input_verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","input_source_proof_status":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetic-syntax-functions — Arithmetic Syntax Operations and Finite Assignments"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"338538aaf52f60c4\" href=\"?note=338538aaf52f60c4\" title=\"67-df-sequence\">67-df-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2fbf7ac563ea4261\" href=\"?note=2fbf7ac563ea4261\" title=\"67-df-pr-definitional-extension\">67-df-pr-definitional-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bc53ba723358facc\" href=\"?note=bc53ba723358facc\" title=\"67-df-satisfaction\">67-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e5654af7c954e1c0\" href=\"?note=e5654af7c954e1c0\" title=\"67-df-godel-encoding\">67-df-godel-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-revised"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮核对形式陈述、类型、变量绑定和册内依赖；未重新核验原书 PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"input_verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"input_source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_{L_A}\">\\(g=c_{L_A}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc},\\operatorname{Len},(a)_i\">\\(\\operatorname{enc},\\operatorname{Len},(a)_i\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"338538aaf52f60c4\" href=\"?note=338538aaf52f60c4\" title=\"67-df-sequence\">67-df-sequence</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\)</span> 为算术公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\">\\(t,u\\)</span> 为算术项；下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_a\">\\(s_a\\)</span> 为标准模型中的变量赋值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ng},\\operatorname{cn},\\operatorname{al},\\operatorname{ex},\\operatorname{eq}\">\\(\\operatorname{ng},\\operatorname{cn},\\operatorname{al},\\operatorname{ex},\\operatorname{eq}\\)</span> 在合法输入上由下式定义；任何不满足对应输入类型的自然数组合均取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tm},\\operatorname{fm},\\operatorname{sn}\">\\(\\operatorname{tm},\\operatorname{fm},\\operatorname{sn}\\)</span> 是值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1\">\\(0,1\\)</span> 的指示函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sub}(n,b,a)\">\\(\\operatorname{sub}(n,b,a)\\)</span> 把编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 指定的各异变量同时换成由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 给出的数词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 可以为空，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 不足长时使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a)_i=0\">\\((a)_i=0\\)</span> 的已定义约定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}\">\\(\\operatorname{val}\\)</span> 在非法项码上取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对本条每个数值函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>，固定程序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_f\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_{\\operatorname{arity}(f)}\">\\(e_f\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_{\\operatorname{arity}(f)}\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦ e_f⟧=f\">\\(⟦ e_f⟧=f\\)</span>。在算术公式中写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 时使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{e_f}\">\\(F_{e_f}\\)</span>，并按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2fbf7ac563ea4261\" href=\"?note=2fbf7ac563ea4261\" title=\"67-df-pr-definitional-extension\">67-df-pr-definitional-extension</a> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_D\">\\(E_D\\)</span>；不将外部函数直接插入原语言。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\">\\(\\vec x\\)</span> 为固定各异变量列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_{\\vec x}=0\">\\(h_{\\vec x}=0\\)</span> 若该列为空，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_{\\vec x}=1+\\max_i\\operatorname{ind}(x_i)\">\\(h_{\\vec x}=1+\\max_i\\operatorname{ind}(x_i)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{assign}_{\\vec x}\">\\(\\operatorname{assign}_{\\vec x}\\)</span> 用于将变量值放入相应下标位置。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,b,a,i,m,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,b,a,i,m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec m\\in\\mathbb N^{|\\vec x|}\">\\(\\vec m\\in\\mathbb N^{|\\vec x|}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_B:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\chi_B:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 取下式的特征函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{decF}_g\">\\(\\operatorname{decF}_g\\)</span> 是仅定义在合法公式码上的逆函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}\">\\(g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{decF}_{L_A,g}\">\\(\\operatorname{decF}_{L_A,g}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e5654af7c954e1c0\" href=\"?note=e5654af7c954e1c0\" title=\"67-df-godel-encoding\">67-df-godel-encoding</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{decF}_g\">\\(\\operatorname{decF}_g\\)</span> 只是后者的本条缩写，不对带标签表达式编号直接作公式域限制。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\chi_B(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;n\\in B,\\\\0,&amp;n\\notin B,\\end{cases}\\quad(B\\subseteq\\mathbb N),\\\\\n\\operatorname{tm}(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\chi_{g[\\mathrm{Term}_{L_A}]}(n),&amp;\n\\operatorname{fm}(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\chi_{g[\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}]}(n),&amp;\n\\operatorname{sn}(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\chi_{g[\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}]}(n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{decF}_g&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{decF}_{L_A,g},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ng}(g(\\varphi))&amp;\\coloneqq g(\\neg\\varphi),&amp;\n\\operatorname{cn}(g(\\varphi),g(\\psi))&amp;\\coloneqq g(\\varphi\\land\\psi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{al}(i,g(\\varphi))&amp;\\coloneqq g(\\forall v_i\\varphi),&amp;\n\\operatorname{ex}(i,g(\\varphi))&amp;\\coloneqq g(\\exists v_i\\varphi),&amp;\n\\operatorname{eq}(g(t),g(u))&amp;\\coloneqq g(t=u),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ng}(n)&amp;\\coloneqq0\\quad(\\operatorname{fm}(n)=0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{cn}(n,m)&amp;\\coloneqq0\\quad(\\operatorname{fm}(n)\\operatorname{fm}(m)=0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{al}(i,n)&amp;\\coloneqq0\\quad(\\operatorname{fm}(n)=0),&amp;\n\\operatorname{ex}(i,n)&amp;\\coloneqq0\\quad(\\operatorname{fm}(n)=0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{eq}(n,m)&amp;\\coloneqq0\\quad(\\operatorname{tm}(n)\\operatorname{tm}(m)=0),\\\\\ns_a(v_i)&amp;\\coloneqq(a)_i,\\\\\n\\operatorname{upd}(a,i,m)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle b_j\\rangle_{j&lt;\\max(\\operatorname{Len}(a),i+1)}),&amp;\nb_j&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}m,&amp;j=i,\\\\(a)_j,&amp;j\\ne i,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}(g(v_i),a)&amp;\\coloneqq(a)_i,&amp;\\operatorname{val}(g(0),a)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}(g(St),a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}(g(t),a)+1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}(g(t+u),a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}(g(t),a)+\\operatorname{val}(g(u),a),\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}(g(t\\times u),a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}(g(t),a)\\operatorname{val}(g(u),a),\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}(n,a)&amp;\\coloneqq0\\quad(\\operatorname{tm}(n)=0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{GoodSub}(n,b)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow n\\in g[\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}]\n\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(b)\\ ((b)_i\\ne(b)_j),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}(n,b,a)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\ng\\!\\left(\\operatorname{decF}_g(n)\n[\\langle\\overline{(a)_j}\\rangle_{j&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(b)}/\\langle v_{(b)_j}\\rangle_{j&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(b)}]\\right),&amp;\n\\operatorname{GoodSub}(n,b),\\\\\n0,&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{GoodSub}(n,b),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nh_{\\vec x}&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0,&amp;|\\vec x|=0,\\\\1+\\max_{i&lt;|\\vec x|}\\operatorname{ind}(x_i),&amp;|\\vec x|&gt;0,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{pack}_k(\\vec m)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\vec m)\\quad(\\vec m\\in\\mathbb N^k),\\\\\n\\operatorname{assign}_{\\vec x}(\\vec m)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle d_j\\rangle_{j&lt;h_{\\vec x}})\n\\quad(\\vec m\\in\\mathbb N^{|\\vec x|}),\\\\\nd_j&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\nm_{\\iota i&lt;|\\vec x|\\ (x_i=v_j)},&amp;v_j\\in\\{x_i:i&lt;|\\vec x|\\},\\\\\n0,&amp;v_j\\notin\\{x_i:i&lt;|\\vec x|\\},\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nb_{\\vec x}&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle\\operatorname{ind}(x_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;|\\vec x|}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\chi_B(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;n\\in B,\\\\0,&amp;n\\notin B,\\end{cases}\\quad(B\\subseteq\\mathbb N),\\\\\n\\operatorname{tm}(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\chi_{g[\\mathrm{Term}_{L_A}]}(n),&amp;\n\\operatorname{fm}(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\chi_{g[\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}]}(n),&amp;\n\\operatorname{sn}(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\chi_{g[\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}]}(n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{decF}_g&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{decF}_{L_A,g},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ng}(g(\\varphi))&amp;\\coloneqq g(\\neg\\varphi),&amp;\n\\operatorname{cn}(g(\\varphi),g(\\psi))&amp;\\coloneqq g(\\varphi\\land\\psi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{al}(i,g(\\varphi))&amp;\\coloneqq g(\\forall v_i\\varphi),&amp;\n\\operatorname{ex}(i,g(\\varphi))&amp;\\coloneqq g(\\exists v_i\\varphi),&amp;\n\\operatorname{eq}(g(t),g(u))&amp;\\coloneqq g(t=u),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ng}(n)&amp;\\coloneqq0\\quad(\\operatorname{fm}(n)=0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{cn}(n,m)&amp;\\coloneqq0\\quad(\\operatorname{fm}(n)\\operatorname{fm}(m)=0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{al}(i,n)&amp;\\coloneqq0\\quad(\\operatorname{fm}(n)=0),&amp;\n\\operatorname{ex}(i,n)&amp;\\coloneqq0\\quad(\\operatorname{fm}(n)=0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{eq}(n,m)&amp;\\coloneqq0\\quad(\\operatorname{tm}(n)\\operatorname{tm}(m)=0),\\\\\ns_a(v_i)&amp;\\coloneqq(a)_i,\\\\\n\\operatorname{upd}(a,i,m)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle b_j\\rangle_{j&lt;\\max(\\operatorname{Len}(a),i+1)}),&amp;\nb_j&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}m,&amp;j=i,\\\\(a)_j,&amp;j\\ne i,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}(g(v_i),a)&amp;\\coloneqq(a)_i,&amp;\\operatorname{val}(g(0),a)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}(g(St),a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}(g(t),a)+1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}(g(t+u),a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}(g(t),a)+\\operatorname{val}(g(u),a),\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}(g(t\\times u),a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}(g(t),a)\\operatorname{val}(g(u),a),\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}(n,a)&amp;\\coloneqq0\\quad(\\operatorname{tm}(n)=0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{GoodSub}(n,b)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow n\\in g[\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}]\n\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(b)\\ ((b)_i\\ne(b)_j),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}(n,b,a)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\ng\\!\\left(\\operatorname{decF}_g(n)\n[\\langle\\overline{(a)_j}\\rangle_{j&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(b)}/\\langle v_{(b)_j}\\rangle_{j&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(b)}]\\right),&amp;\n\\operatorname{GoodSub}(n,b),\\\\\n0,&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{GoodSub}(n,b),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nh_{\\vec x}&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0,&amp;|\\vec x|=0,\\\\1+\\max_{i&lt;|\\vec x|}\\operatorname{ind}(x_i),&amp;|\\vec x|&gt;0,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{pack}_k(\\vec m)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\vec m)\\quad(\\vec m\\in\\mathbb N^k),\\\\\n\\operatorname{assign}_{\\vec x}(\\vec m)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle d_j\\rangle_{j&lt;h_{\\vec x}})\n\\quad(\\vec m\\in\\mathbb N^{|\\vec x|}),\\\\\nd_j&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\nm_{\\iota i&lt;|\\vec x|\\ (x_i=v_j)},&amp;v_j\\in\\{x_i:i&lt;|\\vec x|\\},\\\\\n0,&amp;v_j\\notin\\{x_i:i&lt;|\\vec x|\\},\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nb_{\\vec x}&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle\\operatorname{ind}(x_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;|\\vec x|}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是反思、部分真及固定点实际需要的代码函数，不引入新的数学主题。合法语法的唯一解码保证各分支唯一；非法输入的默认值已经指定。赋值编码允许补零，故变量更新始终是全函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"338538aaf52f60c4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-pr-definitional-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2fbf7ac563ea4261","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-pr-definitional-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"bc53ba723358facc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"e5654af7c954e1c0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-godel-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"338538aaf52f60c4","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$g=c_{L_A}$；$\\operatorname{enc},\\operatorname{Len},(a)_i$ 取 [[67-df-sequence]]。$\\varphi,\\psi$ 为算术公式，$t,u$ 为算术项；下式 $s_a$ 为标准模型中的变量赋值。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-pr-definitional-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2fbf7ac563ea4261","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"对本条每个数值函数 $f$，固定程序 $e_f\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_{\\operatorname{arity}(f)}$，满足 $⟦ e_f⟧=f$。在算术公式中写 $f$ 时使用 $F_{e_f}$，并按 [[67-df-pr-definitional-extension]] 取 $E_D$；不将外部函数直接插入原语言。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"e5654af7c954e1c0","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}$ 与 $\\operatorname{decF}_{L_A,g}$ 取 [[67-df-godel-encoding]]；$\\operatorname{decF}_g$ 只是后者的本条缩写，不对带标签表达式编号直接作公式域限制。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"g=c_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc},\\operatorname{Len},(a)_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"t,u","display":false},{"tex":"s_a","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ng},\\operatorname{cn},\\operatorname{al},\\operatorname{ex},\\operatorname{eq}","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tm},\\operatorname{fm},\\operatorname{sn}","display":false},{"tex":"0,1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sub}(n,b,a)","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"(a)_i=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"e_f\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_{\\operatorname{arity}(f)}","display":false},{"tex":"⟦ e_f⟧=f","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"F_{e_f}","display":false},{"tex":"E_D","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x","display":false},{"tex":"h_{\\vec x}=0","display":false},{"tex":"h_{\\vec x}=1+\\max_i\\operatorname{ind}(x_i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{assign}_{\\vec x}","display":false},{"tex":"n,b,a,i,m,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec m\\in\\mathbb N^{|\\vec x|}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_B:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{decF}_g","display":false},{"tex":"g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{decF}_{L_A,g}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{decF}_g","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\chi_B(n)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&n\\in B,\\\\0,&n\\notin B,\\end{cases}\\quad(B\\subseteq\\mathbb N),\\\\\n\\operatorname{tm}(n)&\\coloneqq\\chi_{g[\\mathrm{Term}_{L_A}]}(n),&\n\\operatorname{fm}(n)&\\coloneqq\\chi_{g[\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}]}(n),&\n\\operatorname{sn}(n)&\\coloneqq\\chi_{g[\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}]}(n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{decF}_g&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{decF}_{L_A,g},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ng}(g(\\varphi))&\\coloneqq g(\\neg\\varphi),&\n\\operatorname{cn}(g(\\varphi),g(\\psi))&\\coloneqq g(\\varphi\\land\\psi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{al}(i,g(\\varphi))&\\coloneqq g(\\forall v_i\\varphi),&\n\\operatorname{ex}(i,g(\\varphi))&\\coloneqq g(\\exists v_i\\varphi),&\n\\operatorname{eq}(g(t),g(u))&\\coloneqq g(t=u),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ng}(n)&\\coloneqq0\\quad(\\operatorname{fm}(n)=0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{cn}(n,m)&\\coloneqq0\\quad(\\operatorname{fm}(n)\\operatorname{fm}(m)=0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{al}(i,n)&\\coloneqq0\\quad(\\operatorname{fm}(n)=0),&\n\\operatorname{ex}(i,n)&\\coloneqq0\\quad(\\operatorname{fm}(n)=0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{eq}(n,m)&\\coloneqq0\\quad(\\operatorname{tm}(n)\\operatorname{tm}(m)=0),\\\\\ns_a(v_i)&\\coloneqq(a)_i,\\\\\n\\operatorname{upd}(a,i,m)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle b_j\\rangle_{j<\\max(\\operatorname{Len}(a),i+1)}),&\nb_j&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}m,&j=i,\\\\(a)_j,&j\\ne i,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}(g(v_i),a)&\\coloneqq(a)_i,&\\operatorname{val}(g(0),a)&\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}(g(St),a)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}(g(t),a)+1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}(g(t+u),a)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}(g(t),a)+\\operatorname{val}(g(u),a),\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}(g(t\\times u),a)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}(g(t),a)\\operatorname{val}(g(u),a),\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}(n,a)&\\coloneqq0\\quad(\\operatorname{tm}(n)=0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{GoodSub}(n,b)&\\Longleftrightarrow n\\in g[\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}]\n\\land\\forall i<j<\\operatorname{Len}(b)\\ ((b)_i\\ne(b)_j),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}(n,b,a)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\ng\\!\\left(\\operatorname{decF}_g(n)\n[\\langle\\overline{(a)_j}\\rangle_{j<\\operatorname{Len}(b)}/\\langle v_{(b)_j}\\rangle_{j<\\operatorname{Len}(b)}]\\right),&\n\\operatorname{GoodSub}(n,b),\\\\\n0,&\\neg\\operatorname{GoodSub}(n,b),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nh_{\\vec x}&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0,&|\\vec x|=0,\\\\1+\\max_{i<|\\vec x|}\\operatorname{ind}(x_i),&|\\vec x|>0,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{pack}_k(\\vec m)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\vec m)\\quad(\\vec m\\in\\mathbb N^k),\\\\\n\\operatorname{assign}_{\\vec x}(\\vec m)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle d_j\\rangle_{j<h_{\\vec x}})\n\\quad(\\vec m\\in\\mathbb N^{|\\vec x|}),\\\\\nd_j&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\nm_{\\iota i<|\\vec x|\\ (x_i=v_j)},&v_j\\in\\{x_i:i<|\\vec x|\\},\\\\\n0,&v_j\\notin\\{x_i:i<|\\vec x|\\},\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nb_{\\vec x}&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle\\operatorname{ind}(x_i)\\rangle_{i<|\\vec x|}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":5680,"backlinks":[{"id":"0e6c8c75d056b765","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$e_{h_c}\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_3$、$e_{h_{\\operatorname{tm}}}\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_1$ 分别实现下式的三元与一元零值检查函数；$C_{\\varepsilon,n}$ 在下式是公式代码的识别公式，$c_{\\varepsilon,n}$ 另限定为句子代码。$\\mathrm{Tm}$ 在下式定义；$\\mathrm{Snt}$ 精确使用 [[67-df-formula-provability]] 的同一个公式；代码函数取 [[67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions]]。"},{"id":"045076ed5daf4d97","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$z$ 为公理代码变量，$v$ 为证明公式的结论代码变量；$y$ 为与二者不同的新鲜变量。$\\operatorname{decF}_g$、$\\operatorname{sn}$ 取 [[67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions]]。"},{"id":"25293634b979c36f","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$g=c_{L_A}$，$\\vec x=\\operatorname{VList}(\\mat